3 Bedroom Villa of Modern and Contemporary Architecture with Swimming Pool in Praia da Luz, Lagos.

This magnificent 3 bedroom villa for sale, located in the prestigious Monte de Lemos, in Praia da Luz, Lagos, offers a perfect combination of luxury, modernity and comfort. With a contemporary architecture, the house is spread over three floors and has three bedrooms, all en suite, ensuring total privacy and comfort.

Prime location

Situated in an elevated position, the villa offers stunning panoramic views of the sea and the tranquillity of the surrounding area. Within walking distance of the village centre and the famous Praia da Luz, you can enjoy the most beautiful beaches in Lagos, as well as all the necessary services and amenities, such as restaurants, shops and supermarkets.

Distribution of Spaces

On the upper level is a spacious and elegant living and dining room that integrates with a state-of-the-art kitchen, fully equipped with modern appliances that combine state-of-the-art technology with a sophisticated design. Through the living room, you have direct access to a large terrace with stunning views and the garden where the wonderful swimming pool is located, ideal for relaxing and enjoying moments outdoors.

Features and Equipment

This property stands out for its high quality finishes and the exceptional features it offers:

Double glazing for efficient thermal and acoustic insulation;

Air conditioning throughout the house, ensuring comfort in all seasons;

Electric underfloor heating, providing pleasant warmth during the colder months;

Central vacuum system, facilitating cleaning and maintenance of the space;

Integrated sound system, ideal for creating an immersive atmosphere in any room of the house;

High security entrance door, to ensure maximum protection;

Complete alarm system, reinforcing property security;

Electric blinds that can be easily controlled for greater convenience;

LED lighting, efficient and modern, providing a sophisticated and welcoming atmosphere.

A Luxury Getaway

This unique villa is the perfect example of modern luxury, with a design thought out in detail to ensure maximum comfort and functionality. Its large and bright spaces, combined with the tranquillity of the location and the impressive views, make this villa a dream property, ideal for those looking for a permanent residence or a second home in the Algarve.

Don't miss this opportunity to acquire a villa of excellence in one of the most coveted areas of the Algarve! Contact us for more information or to schedule a visit.

